              is the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/diagonal+morphism"} diagonal
              on the
              %em set
              underlying the degree=
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n
