                    \\big)^{op}
                    ,
                    Set
                    \\Big)
            %p
              implies that this natural transformation
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:CupSquareInMultiplicativeCohomologyNaturalTransformation"} (2)
              between the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/representable+functors"} representable functors
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
